  "description": "An illustrative map from SNOMED CT condition codes that occur in the sample data to ICD-10 2019, used by the conditions-to-icd10 query. It is not a clinically validated map. One element is marked noMap to show that a code the map says has no mapping is a row with a null target. Author: John Grimes.",
